`game/audio/paint_exe/` retains the replacement recordings, editable
scores/recipes and exported WAVs for POL#22. These files are distributed; they
are separate from the legacy live bank described below. Exact per-file creators,
source URLs, licence evidence, modifications and hashes are recorded in
